<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Bayesian Test-time Adaptation for Object Recognition and Detection with Vision-language Models<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>
