<span id="tab1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block">
<span id="tab1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lihua Zhou</span>  received the Ph.D. degree from the University of Electronic Science and Technology of China in 2024. He is currently a Postdoctoral Research Fellow at the Centre for Artificial Intelligence and Robotics (CAIR), Hong Kong Institute of Science and Innovation, Chinese Academy of Sciences, China, Hong Kong. His research interests include machine learning, computer vision, and transfer learning.</span>
</span></td></tr>
